{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ba0f9a73-a534-83b2-8e78-7243496adcfd",
  "created_at": "2026-01-02T14:42:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Conceicao Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T14:40:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Happy New Year, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T14:41:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, happy New Year. I'm calling about a dip in the road. It's at 438 Eustis Avenue, in front of the house, more or less."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T14:41:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "438 Eustis Avenue. And what's it look like, is it a pothole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T14:41:14-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not exactly a hole. They dug a trench there in the fall for the gas, no, the utility line, and it settled. Now there's a dip, about a foot and a half across, I'd say. Cars bang right through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T14:41:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a utility trench that settled and left a dip. On Eustis Avenue, number 438. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T14:41:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. I have a few photos on my phone, if you want them. I can send them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T14:41:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, photos would help. I'll note that they're available, and the crew can follow up on how to get them from you. Do you want me to put down a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T14:41:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0171."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T14:41:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0171. Got it. Let me enter this in. [pause] Okay, it's in the system."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T14:42:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I get a reference number for it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T14:42:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Have a pen? It's PW, then 2 6, 0 1 0 2, then 1 4. I'll repeat it. PW 26 0102 14."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T14:42:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "PW 26 0102 14. Got it, thank you. Well, I'm heading to the hardware store now, for a bag of lightbulbs, so I'll let you go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T14:42:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Thanks for calling, and have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T14:42:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
